# Diagnostics
```
invalid-module-no-fix.js:3:1 lint/nursery/noUselessAwait ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  i This value is never a promise, so await is unnecessary.
  
    1 │ /* should generate diagnostics */
    2 │ Promise.resolve().then(() => log("a"));
  > 3 │ await 1;
      │ ^^^^^
    4 │ log("b");
    5 │ 
  
  i Awaiting a value that isn't a promise returns the same value, but still delays the code that follows it.
  
  i Remove await. To wait for several promises, pass them to Promise.all() instead.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

```
